is BUSY (exit 3).\n\ncancel SIGTERMs the supervisor's process group and the supervisor\ntranslates that into registry.cancel (SIGTERM to the agent's own group,\nCANCELLED record). After 5s without a terminal record, cancel SIGKILLs\nboth groups and writes the CANCELLED record itself. Cancelling a\nterminal job prints its record and exits 0; an unknown id exits 2.\n\nThe supervisor's cancel path uses a SIGTERM handler plus self-pipe\nrather than a blocked mask, so the agent child never inherits a blocked\nSIGTERM. Kill finalization now marks the result itself CANCELLED or\nSTALLED to match the record status.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Muse Spark 1.3 <noreply@opencode.ai>\" && git log --oneline -2 && git status --short","timeout":120}}],"api":"openai-responses","provider":"opencode-go","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","usage":{"input":640,"output":478,"cacheRead":124017,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":59,"totalTokens":125135,"cost":{"input":0.00006400000000000001,"output":0.0000956,"cacheRead":0.000248034,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00040763400000000003}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1790850663162,"responseId":"resp_6abe366a50b46eac5b3b4874","rawStopReason":"completed","thinkingLevel":"high"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_01a0f70494a8762897d3a99a2d78207c|fc_01a0f70494a8762897d3a99a2d78207c","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"10-resume-cancel\n src/cli.rs           | 502 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--------\n src/job_registry.rs  |  10 +-\n src/status_record.rs |  58 +++++-\n src/types.rs         |  12 ++\n tests/cli_e2e.rs     | 261 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n 5 files changed, 765 insertions(+), 78 deletions(-)\n[10-resume-cancel c4d324c] feat: delegate resume and cancel (#10)\n 5 files changed, 765 insertions(+), 78 deletions(-)\nc4d324c feat: delegate resume and cancel (#10)\n32f6424 feat: gate, change-set, idle watchdog and cwd write lock (#9) (#23)\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1790850672743},{"role":"assistant","content":[{